---@field voiceSettings? aws.lex_models_v2.VoiceSettings The Amazon Polly voice ID that Amazon Lex uses for voice interaction with the user.
---@field unifiedSpeechSettings? aws.lex_models_v2.UnifiedSpeechSettings The unified speech settings configured for the created bot locale.
